  --~|array;define;DataGoat;10;;;4;1d8;12;10;11;2;10;5;40 ft.;0;;; ;;passive Perception 10;0;Medium;10;0; Charge;If the goat moves at least 20 ft. straight toward a target and then hits it with a ram attack on the same turn, the target takes an extra 2 (or [&Obracket][&Obracket]1d4[&Cbracket][&Cbracket] (1d4)) bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 10 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.;Sure-Footed;The goat has advantage on Strength and Dexterity saving throws made against effects that would knock it prone.;;;;; Ram;true;on;Melee;5 ft.;one target;3;1d4 + 1;bludgeoning;;;; ;false;0;Melee;;;0;;;;;; ;false;0;Melee;;;0;;;;;; ;false;0;Melee;;;0;;;;;; ;0;;0;;0;;0;478498748/9w9ukNsL58RnN8WzpmxKfw/original.png;;
